  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tourism development in S&#xE3;o Vicente and Santo Ant&#xE3;o, Cabo Verde</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Cabo Verdean travel agency business is affected by the absence of a national tourism policy and marketing strategy, the absence of proper regulation, the lack of collective and individual organization and the outdated business model of the local and independent travel agencies.This project aims to boost the economic benefits for the local private Cabo Verdean tourism sector by improving the position of the local Santo Ant&#xE3;o and S&#xE3;o Vicente-based travel associations and travel agencies and diversifying their tourism services potential to serve new market segments.The local travel agencies will have augmented bargaining power and negotiation positions vis-&#xE0;-vis the global tour operators. The local supply chain will have better opportunities to be integrated into the tourism value chain.</narrative>
  </description>
